      "when": {
        "location": "cottage_home",
        "flags_not_set": [
          "looked_around"
        ]
      },
      "result": "You take in the cottage's cozy glow. Outside, the garden brightens with color and soft birdsong. The air feels fresh and welcoming, and you take a moment to enjoy the simple calm before choosing what comes next.",
